# Delivery Workbench self-hosting extension seam (project-owned;
# survives update.sh).
#
# Until WLA-6-02, this file duplicated the structural gate checks for
# the nested pmo-roadmap/pm/roadmap prefix because the canonical hook
# was anchored at ^pm/roadmap/. The `dw gate` engine now derives the
# roadmap root via dw_pmo (which understands the self-hosted layout),
# so the duplication is gone — exactly the shrink-to-nothing predicted
# in phase-6 evidence-story-01.
#
# The seam remains available for genuine project-specific rules; see
# pmo-roadmap/templates/PMO-CONTRACT.md §"Extending".
